[Triggers]
Block	1	CaveHornet
Block	1	Rat
Block	1	Roach
Block	1	Goblin
Block	1	LizardMan
Block	1	Orc
Region	WestGlade	8	40	26	64
Region	SouthGlade	33	78	64	92
Region	MiddleGlade	34	36	62	60
Region	NorthGlade	38	6	64	22
Region	EastGlade	72	46	92	70
Region	WitchHold	7	8	30	27
Region	RivalKeep	72	8	92	26
Region	SealedGrove	2	36	9	45
Region	PortalCave	74	78	92	92
[Trigger]
Name	mist
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Master, Wraithwood is a forest of grey trunks and drifting fog, and Witch-Warden Elowen Ash has bound a rival keeper to her cause. Their two hearts lie at opposite corners of the wood.
Action	objective	1	Destroy the heart of the witch-warden in the north-west.
Action	objective	1	Destroy the heart of the rival keeper in the north-east.
Action	objective	1	Hold your own heart against the heroes of the kingdom.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	westGlade
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	WestGlade
Action	message	1	The west glade. The witch-warden's road climbs north from here, closed with earth, and a creek bars the way east.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	grove
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SealedGrove
Action	message	1	A grove the fog had hidden. Someone buried a hoard under the roots long ago.
Action	gold	1	900
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	southGlade
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SouthGlade
Action	message	1	The south glade. The road east runs to the hero portal. Every column of the kingdom will come this way.
Action	reveal	1	PortalCave
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	middle
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	MiddleGlade
Action	message	1	The middle glade. The witch and the keeper watch it from both sides, and what one of them sees the other hears.
Action	reveal	1	NorthGlade
Action	reveal	1	EastGlade
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	covenStirs
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	WitchHold
Action	message	1	Elowen Ash has seen you. Her coven comes to the gate.
Action	spawn	3	28	15	1	DarkElf:5	Cultist:5	LizardMan:5	Spider:5
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	keeperStirs
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	RivalKeep
Action	message	1	The rival keeper has called out every pack he owns.
Action	spawn	2	71	15	1	Troll:5	Orc:5	Orc:5	Goblin:5
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	bond
Mode	once
Cond	time	900
Action	message	1	The witch-warden and the rival keeper have sent one pack to each other. Whichever heart you strike, the other will answer.
Action	spawn	2	28	15	1	Orc:5	Troll:5	Goblin:5
Action	spawn	3	71	15	1	DarkElf:5	Cultist:5	Spider:5
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	mined1
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	4000
Action	message	1	The wood's seams are paying. The heroes will not wait for you to finish building.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	bothFall
Mode	once
Cond	time	5
Cond	creatures	2	<=	0
Cond	creatures	3	<=	0
Action	message	1	The witch-warden and the rival keeper are both dead and the fog lifts from Wraithwood. The wood is yours.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	bothFallGoal
Mode	once
Cond	goal	1	KillAllEnemies
Action	message	1	The witch-warden and the rival keeper are both dead and the fog lifts from Wraithwood. The wood is yours.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	gladeWell
Mode	once
Cond	slabs	1	WestGlade	claimed	>=	40
Action	message	1	The west glade is yours, master, and the fog over its middle has thinned to a spring of mana. Claim it with a worker.
Action	terrain	17	52	17	52	manawell
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
